---
layout: layouts/base.njk
section: cruises
pagination:
  data: ships
  size: 1
  alias: ship
permalink: "/cruises/{{ ship.slug }}/"
eleventyComputed:
  title: "{{ ship.name }}: a first-timer's ship guide"
  description: "{{ ship.summary }} A plain-English guide to the {{ ship.name }} for first-time cruisers."
---
<section class="page-hero">
  <div class="wrap page-hero-row">
    <div class="page-hero-copy">
      <nav class="crumbs" aria-label="Breadcrumb"><a href="/cruises/">Disney Cruise Line</a> <span aria-hidden="true">›</span> <a href="/cruises/#ships">Ships</a></nav>
      <p class="eyebrow">{% if ship.cls != "[VERIFY]" %}{{ ship.cls }} · {% endif %}{% if ship.year > 2026 %}Debuts{% else %}Entered service{% endif %} {{ ship.year }}</p>
      <h1>{{ ship.name }}</h1>
      <p class="lead">{{ ship.summary }}</p>
      {% if ship.sailed %}<p class="badge">We've sailed this ship</p>{% endif %}
      <p class="byline">{% if ship.overview %}<span class="badge badge-researched">Researched guide</span> {% endif %}Facts last checked {% if ship.overview %}November 2026{% else %}[DATE]{% endif %}</p>
    </div>
    {% if ship.photo %}
    <img class="hero-img" src="{{ ship.photo.src }}" srcset="{{ ship.photo.small }} 800w, {{ ship.photo.src }} 1600w" sizes="(max-width: 820px) 100vw, 540px" width="{{ ship.photo.width }}" height="{{ ship.photo.height }}" alt="{{ ship.photo.alt }}">
    {% else %}
    {% set label = ship.name %}
    <div class="hero-soon">{% include "coming-soon.njk" %}</div>
    {% endif %}
  </div>
</section>

<div class="wrap guide-row">
  <article class="guide">
    <nav class="toc card" aria-label="On this page">
      <strong>On this page</strong>
      <ol>
        <li><a href="#overview">Overview and who it suits</a></li>
        <li><a href="#facts">Ship facts</a></li>
        <li><a href="#staterooms">Staterooms</a></li>
        <li><a href="#dining">Dining</a></li>
        <li><a href="#kids-teens-adults">Kids, teens and adults</a></li>
        <li><a href="#pools">Pools and water features</a></li>
        <li><a href="#entertainment">Shows and entertainment</a></li>
        {% if ship.deckList %}<li><a href="#decks">Deck by deck</a></li>{% endif %}
        <li><a href="#itineraries">Itineraries and ports</a></li>
        <li><a href="#pros-cons">Pros, cons and tips</a></li>
      </ol>
    </nav>

    <h2 id="overview">Overview and who it suits</h2>
    {% if ship.overview %}<p>{{ ship.overview }}</p>{% endif %}
    {% if ship.sailed %}<p class="todo">[YOUR TAKE FROM YOUR SAILING: when you sailed, the itinerary, and what stood out. WHO THIS SHIP IS BEST FOR, AND WHO MIGHT PREFER ANOTHER SHIP.]</p>
    {% elif ship.overview %}<div class="callout callout-soft"><strong>First-hand notes coming soon.</strong><p>This ship guide is put together from research. A first-hand take and photos will be added later.</p></div>
    {% else %}<p class="todo">[WHO THIS SHIP IS BEST FOR, AND WHO MIGHT PREFER ANOTHER SHIP.]</p>{% endif %}

    <h2 id="facts">Ship facts</h2>
    <div class="card facts facts-inline">
      <dl>
        {% for f in [["Class", ship.cls], ["Maiden voyage", ship.maiden], ["Size", ship.size], ["Staterooms", ship.staterooms], ["Guests", ship.guests], ["Decks", ship.decks], ["Home ports", ship.homePorts]] %}
        <dt>{{ f[0] }}</dt>{% if f[1] and "[VERIFY" not in f[1] %}<dd>{{ f[1] }}</dd>{% elif f[1] %}<dd class="todo">{{ f[1] }}</dd>{% else %}<dd class="todo">[VERIFY]</dd>{% endif %}
        {% endfor %}
      </dl>
    </div>

    <h2 id="staterooms">Staterooms</h2>
    <p>Disney Cruise Line rooms fall into four main groups. Here's how they play out on the {{ ship.name }}.</p>
    <div class="rooms">
      <div class="card"><h3>Inside</h3><p class="todo">[WHAT THEY'RE LIKE ON THIS SHIP AND WHO THEY SUIT]</p></div>
      <div class="card"><h3>Oceanview</h3><p class="todo">[WHAT THEY'RE LIKE ON THIS SHIP AND WHO THEY SUIT]</p></div>
      <div class="card"><h3>Verandah</h3><p class="todo">[WHAT THEY'RE LIKE ON THIS SHIP AND WHO THEY SUIT]</p></div>
      <div class="card"><h3>Concierge</h3><p class="todo">[WHAT THEY'RE LIKE ON THIS SHIP AND WHO THEY SUIT]</p></div>
    </div>
    <p class="todo">[WHICH ROOMS OR DECKS TO BOOK, AND WHICH TO AVOID]</p>

    <h2 id="dining">Dining</h2>
    <h3>Main dining rotation</h3>
    <p>Most nights you rotate between the main restaurants, and your servers move with you.</p>
    <ul class="ticks">{% for r in ship.rotation %}<li>{% if r == "[VERIFY]" %}<span class="todo">[VERIFY RESTAURANTS]</span>{% else %}{{ r }}{% endif %}</li>{% endfor %}</ul>
    <p class="todo">[WHAT EACH ONE IS LIKE, AND YOUR FAVORITE]</p>
    <h3>Adult-only dining</h3>
    <ul class="ticks">{% for r in ship.adult %}<li>{% if r == "[VERIFY]" %}<span class="todo">[VERIFY]</span>{% else %}{{ r }}{% endif %}</li>{% endfor %}</ul>
    <p class="todo">[IS IT WORTH THE EXTRA COST? CHECK CURRENT PRICES BEFORE MENTIONING THEM.]</p>
    <h3>Quick-service and snacks</h3>
    <p class="todo">[POOL DECK FOOD, COFFEE, ROOM SERVICE TIPS]</p>

    <h2 id="kids-teens-adults">Kids, teens and adults</h2>
    <h3>Kids and teens</h3>
    <ul class="ticks">{% for k in ship.kids %}<li>{% if k == "[VERIFY]" %}<span class="todo">[VERIFY]</span>{% else %}{{ k }}{% endif %}</li>{% endfor %}</ul>
    {% if ship.sailed %}<p class="todo">[WHAT YOUR KIDS THOUGHT, IF YOU SAILED WITH KIDS]</p>{% endif %}
    <h3>Adults</h3>
    {% if ship.adults %}<ul class="ticks">{% for a in ship.adults %}<li>{{ a }}</li>{% endfor %}</ul>{% else %}<p class="todo">[ADULT-ONLY POOL, LOUNGES, SPA, AND QUIET SPOTS]</p>{% endif %}

    <h2 id="pools">Pools and water features</h2>
    <p><strong>Signature water ride:</strong> {% if ship.water == "[VERIFY]" %}<span class="todo">[VERIFY]</span>{% else %}{{ ship.water }}{% endif %}</p>
    {% if ship.pools %}<p>{{ ship.pools }}</p>{% else %}<p class="todo">[FAMILY POOLS, SPLASH AREAS, ADULT POOL, AND HOW BUSY THEY GET]</p>{% endif %}

    <h2 id="entertainment">Shows and entertainment</h2>
    {% if ship.shows %}<p>Recent stage shows in the main theater include:</p><ul class="ticks">{% for x in ship.shows %}<li>{{ x }}</li>{% endfor %}</ul><p class="fineprint">Show lineups change, so check the Navigator app for your sailing.</p>{% else %}<p class="todo">[STAGE SHOWS, DECK PARTIES, FIREWORKS AT SEA, MOVIES, CHARACTER MEET-AND-GREETS. CHECK THE CURRENT SHOW LINEUP.]</p>{% endif %}

{% if ship.deckList %}
    <h2 id="decks">Deck by deck</h2>
    <div class="table-scroll">
      <table class="deck-table">
        <thead><tr><th scope="col">Deck</th><th scope="col">What's there</th></tr></thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr><th scope="row" class="todo">[DECK]</th><td class="todo">[WHAT'S ON THIS DECK]</td></tr>
          <tr><th scope="row" class="todo">[DECK]</th><td class="todo">[WHAT'S ON THIS DECK]</td></tr>
          <tr><th scope="row" class="todo">[DECK]</th><td class="todo">[WHAT'S ON THIS DECK]</td></tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>

{% endif %}
    <h2 id="itineraries">Itineraries and ports</h2>
    {% if ship.itineraries %}
    <p>Where the {{ ship.name }} is scheduled to sail, from now through Disney's latest published schedule. Dates and ports can change, so always check Disney's site before you book.</p>
    <div class="itins">
      {% for it in ship.itineraries %}
      <section class="card itin">
        <p class="eyebrow">{{ it.when }}</p>
        <h3>{{ it.route }}</h3>
        <p class="itin-meta"><strong>From</strong> {{ it.port }} · <strong>Length</strong> {{ it.length }}</p>
        {% if it.highlights %}<ul class="ticks">{% for h in it.highlights %}<li>{{ h }}</li>{% endfor %}</ul>{% endif %}
        <div class="itin-take"><p class="itin-take-head">Why it's worth a look <span class="draft-tag">Draft for Ryan</span></p><p>{{ it.take }}</p></div>
        {% if it.verify %}<p class="itin-verify">Dates from a fan schedule, not yet confirmed by Disney.</p>{% endif %}
      </section>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
    {% else %}
    <p class="todo">[WHERE THIS SHIP SAILS NOW, TYPICAL LENGTHS, AND WHICH PRIVATE ISLAND STOPS ARE INCLUDED. CHECK DISNEY'S CURRENT SCHEDULE.]</p>
    {% endif %}

    <h2 id="pros-cons">Pros, cons and tips</h2>
    <div class="proscons">
      <div class="card"><h3>Love</h3><ul class="ticks">{% if ship.pros %}{% for x in ship.pros %}<li>{{ x }}</li>{% endfor %}{% else %}<li class="todo">[PRO]</li><li class="todo">[PRO]</li>{% endif %}</ul></div>
      <div class="card"><h3>Keep in mind</h3><ul class="ticks">{% if ship.cons %}{% for x in ship.cons %}<li>{{ x }}</li>{% endfor %}{% else %}<li class="todo">[CON]</li><li class="todo">[CON]</li>{% endif %}</ul></div>
    </div>
    <h3>First-timer tips</h3>
    {% if ship.tips %}<ul class="ticks">{% for x in ship.tips %}<li>{{ x }}</li>{% endfor %}</ul>{% else %}<p class="todo">[TWO OR THREE PRACTICAL TIPS FOR THIS SHIP]</p>{% endif %}
  </article>

  <aside class="guide-side">
    <div class="card facts">
      <h2>At a glance</h2>
      <dl>
        <dt>Class</dt><dd>{{ ship.cls }}</dd>
        <dt>{% if ship.year > 2026 %}Debuts{% else %}Entered service{% endif %}</dt><dd>{{ ship.year }}</dd>
        <dt>Home ports</dt><dd>{{ ship.homePorts or "[VERIFY]" }}</dd>
        <dt>Water ride</dt><dd>{{ ship.water }}</dd>
        <dt>Facts last checked</dt>{% if ship.overview %}<dd>November 2026</dd>{% else %}<dd class="todo">[DATE]</dd>{% endif %}
      </dl>
      <a class="btn btn-outline-dark compare-link" href="/cruises/#compare">Compare all ships</a>
    </div>
    <div class="card nearby">
      <h2>Other ships</h2>
      <ul>{% for s in ships %}{% if s.slug != ship.slug %}<li><a href="/cruises/{{ s.slug }}/">{{ s.name }}</a> <small>{{ s.cls }}</small></li>{% endif %}{% endfor %}</ul>
    </div>
  </aside>
</div>
